<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 184 0 R
/E (The Lab Equipment Circulation & Maintenance Tracker is a menu-driven, console-based application developed using Python with MySQL as its back-end database. It is designed for use in a school, college or institutional laboratory where equipment is shared by students, teachers and laboratory staff. The system maintains a central record of laboratory equipment and helps track when an item is issued, who receives it, when it is due for return and whether it requires maintenance.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
266 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 184 0 R
/E (The project stores equipment details such as equipment name, category, serial number, condition, availability status, laboratory location and remarks. It also maintains separate records for circulation transactions and maintenance activities in a relational MySQL database.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
